        <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.1rem,4.2vw,3.2rem);margin-top:18px">Remote Team vs In-House Team: The True Cost Comparison</h1>
        <p class="post-meta" style="margin-top:14px">October 23, 2026 · 9 min read · By the Remote Team Partners team</p>
      </div>
      <div class="post-hero-img">
